    "Pick what you want to see first, or keep All. This is a focus—not an identity—and you can change it later without losing any people or plans." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pick what you want to see first, or keep All. This is a focus—not an identity—and you can change it later without losing any people or plans."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Выберите, что показывать первым, или оставьте «Все». Это фокус, а не идентичность; его можно изменить позже без потери людей и планов."
